abstract: >-
  Auditable Open Problem Difficulty Profiles for 8,785 problems, preserving
  the 5,426-record UnsolvedMath v1.2.0 compatibility base and appending 3,359
  AIM Workshop Problem Lists records from v1.5.0, prepared by Alejandro
  Zarzuelo Urdiales with ChatGPT 5.6 Sol.
keywords:
